    <briefdescription>
<para>An iterator type that allows iterating over the pointees via some other iterator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The typical usage of this is to expose a type that iterates over Ts, but which is implemented with some iterator over T*s:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">using<sp/></highlight><highlight class="normal">iterator<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="structllvm_1_1pointee__iterator_1adf01b96db9ddeda9a3edfc4bd6b392b8" kindref="member">pointee_iterator&lt;SmallVectorImpl&lt;T *&gt;::iterator</ref>&gt;;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
